From 6808738ad5c7249b32199513c20a060d8e839b4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 20:43:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(leads): count SLA in business days and make late-lead
 alerts less noisy

- DEFAULT_LEAD_SLA is in business days (Mon-Fri); new goes from 1 to 2.
- Late-lead task is due the next business day in the Madrid calendar.
- Owner falls back to the account owner, then the company owner.
- Four or more late leads per person become one grouped suggestion.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
